<style>
:root{--paper:#fffdf9;--ink:#1e293b;--accent:#c1435b;--muted:#64748b;--line:#e2e8f0;--serif:Georgia,'Times New Roman',serif;--sans:system-ui,-apple-system,'Segoe UI',Roboto,sans-serif}
html[data-theme=dark]{--paper:#221a1f;--ink:#f1e4dd;--accent:#e8889b;--muted:#b89d93;--line:#45323a}
html[lang="en"] .lang-vi{display:none}
html[lang="vi"] .lang-en{display:none}
*{box-sizing:border-box;margin:0;padding:0}
body{font:400 10.5pt/1.55 var(--sans);color:var(--ink);background:var(--paper)}
.cv{max-width:210mm;margin:0 auto;padding:16mm 16mm 20mm;background:var(--paper);box-shadow:0 0 0 1px var(--line),0 10px 30px rgba(60,40,30,.08)}
header{border-bottom:2px solid var(--accent);padding-bottom:12px;margin-bottom:16px}
h1{font:700 19pt var(--serif);color:var(--accent)}
h1 small{font:400 10pt var(--sans);color:var(--muted);display:block;margin-top:2px}
.roles{font:600 10pt var(--sans);margin-top:5px}
.contact{font-size:9pt;color:var(--muted);margin-top:5px}
.contact a{color:var(--muted);text-decoration:none}
h2{font:700 11.5pt var(--sans);color:var(--accent);letter-spacing:.06em;text-transform:uppercase;margin:16px 0 6px;padding-bottom:3px;border-bottom:1px solid var(--line)}
p{margin:4px 0}
ul{margin:2px 0 8px 18px}
li{margin:3px 0}
h3{font:600 10.5pt var(--sans);margin:8px 0 2px}
.venue{font-style:italic;color:var(--muted);font-size:9.5pt}
.yr{font:600 9pt var(--sans);color:var(--accent)}
a{color:var(--accent)}
.tools{position:fixed;top:10px;right:12px;display:flex;gap:8px;z-index:50;flex-wrap:wrap;justify-content:flex-end}
.tools button{border:1px solid var(--line);border-radius:16px;background:#fff;color:var(--ink);font:600 8.5pt var(--sans);padding:6px 12px;cursor:pointer;box-shadow:0 4px 12px rgba(60,40,30,.12);white-space:nowrap}
.tools button:hover{border-color:var(--accent);color:var(--accent)}
.tools button.active{background:var(--accent);color:#fff;border-color:var(--accent)}
html[data-theme=dark] .tools button{background:#30232b}
@media(max-width:640px){.tools{top:6px;right:6px;gap:6px}.tools button{padding:5px 9px;font-size:8pt}}
@media(max-width:640px){.cv{padding:12mm 8mm 14mm}body{font-size:10pt}}
@media print{
  @page{size:A4;margin:12mm 10mm}
  .tools{display:none}
  .cv{box-shadow:none;margin:0;max-width:none;padding:0}
  body{background:#fff}
  a{text-decoration:none;color:inherit}
  h2{break-after:avoid}
  li{break-inside:avoid}
}
</style>
</head>
<body>
<div class="tools">
  <button onclick="window.print()"><span lang="vi">🖨 In / Lưu PDF</span><span lang="en">🖨 Print / Save PDF</span></button>
  <button onclick="location.href='publications.html#main'"><span lang="vi">↩ Về trang Công bố</span><span lang="en">↩ Back to Publications</span></button>
  <button id="cv-theme" type="button"><span lang="vi">◐ Sáng / Tối</span><span lang="en">◐ Light / Dark</span></button>
  <span class="langtog" id="cv-lang">
    <button type="button" data-lang="vi">🇻🇳 VI</button>
    <button type="button" data-lang="en">🇬🇧 EN</button>
  </span>
</div>
<script>(function(){var r=document.documentElement;var c=r.getAttribute('data-theme')||(matchMedia('(prefers-color-scheme:dark)').matches?'dark':'light');r.setAttribute('data-theme',c);var t=document.getElementById('cv-theme');if(t)t.addEventListener('click',function(){r.setAttribute('data-theme',r.getAttribute('data-theme')==='dark'?'light':'dark')});var b=document.querySelectorAll('#cv-lang button');function set(l){r.setAttribute('lang',l);b.forEach(function(x){x.classList.toggle('active',x.getAttribute('data-lang')===l);});try{localStorage.setItem('huong_lang',l);}catch(e){}}b.forEach(function(x){x.addEventListener('click',function(){set(x.getAttribute('data-lang'));});});try{set(localStorage.getItem('huong_lang')||((/^en/i.test(navigator.language))?'en':'vi'));}catch(e){set('vi');}})();</script>
<div class="cv" id="main">
  <header>
    <h1>Do Thuy Huong · <span lang="vi">Đỗ Thùy Hương</span>
      <small>«Je m'appelle Hương» · Lecturer &amp; Researcher</small>
    </h1>
    <div class="roles"><span class="lang-vi">Giảng viên · Nghiên cứu sinh tiến sĩ</span><span class="lang-en">Lecturer · PhD Candidate</span></div>
    <div class="contact">
      <span class="lang-vi">Khoa Kinh tế, Đại học Cần Thơ, Việt Nam</span><span class="lang-en">School of Economics, Can Tho University, Viet Nam</span> ·
      <a href="mailto:thuyhuongctu@gmail.com">thuyhuongctu@gmail.com</a> ·
      <a href="https://scholar.google.com/citations?user=thuyhuongctu" target="_blank" rel="noopener">Google Scholar</a> ·
      <a href="https://www.researchgate.net/profile/Do-Thuy-Huong" target="_blank" rel="noopener">ResearchGate</a> ·
      <a href="https://thuyhuongctu.github.io/JESUISHUONG_WEBSITE_2026/" target="_blank" rel="noopener">thuyhuongctu.github.io/JESUISHUONG_WEBSITE_2026</a>
    </div>
  </header>

  <h2><span class="lang-vi">Học vấn</span><span class="lang-en">Education</span></h2>
  <h3>PhD in Business Administration <span class="venue">— Can Tho University (ongoing, supervision: Assoc. Prof. Dr. Phan Anh Tu)</span></h3>
  <p class="venue"><span class="lang-vi">Luận án: chiến lược quốc tế hóa doanh nghiệp và hiệu quả hoạt động — phân tích tổng hợp đa quốc gia, dữ liệu World Bank.</span><span class="lang-en">Dissertation: corporate internationalization strategy and firm performance — multi-country meta-analysis, World Bank data.</span></p>

  <h2><span class="lang-vi">Vị trí hiện tại</span><span class="lang-en">Current positions</span></h2>
  <ul>
    <li><span class="yr">2024–now</span> — Lecturer, School of Economics, Can Tho University, Viet Nam <span class="venue"><span class="lang-vi">(giảng dạy khởi nghiệp, kinh doanh quốc tế, kinh tế học)</span><span class="lang-en">(teaching entrepreneurship, international business, economics)</span></span></li>
    <li><span class="yr">2024–now</span> — PhD Candidate, Can Tho University <span class="venue">(international business)</span></li>
  </ul>

  <h2><span class="lang-vi">Hướng nghiên cứu</span><span class="lang-en">Research interests</span></h2>
  <p><span class="lang-vi">Quốc tế hóa doanh nghiệp · Hiệu quả hoạt động doanh nghiệp · Phân tích tổng hợp (meta-analysis) · AI trong giáo dục đại học · Khởi sự doanh nghiệp · Kinh tế phát triển (tài chính · kinh tế · ESG)</span><span class="lang-en">Corporate internationalization · Firm performance · Meta-analysis · AI in higher education · Entrepreneurship · Development economics (finance · economy · ESG)</span></p>

  <h2><span class="lang-vi">Công bố khoa học</span><span class="lang-en">Publications</span> <span class="venue">(19 works — full list with DOI at <a href="https://thuyhuongctu.github.io/JESUISHUONG_WEBSITE_2026/publications.html" target="_blank" rel="noopener">publications.html</a>)</span></h2>
  <ul>
    <li>Unveiling the impact of Chinese Manufacturing SMEs' Internationalization on Performance. <span class="venue">Journal of Finance and Accounting Research, 2026.</span></li>
    <li>Firm performance heterogeneity in emerging Asia. <span class="venue">Vietnam Economic &amp; Financial Review, 2026.</span></li>
    <li>Institutional Completeness and the Internationalization–Performance Relationship: Capability Ceiling and Dual Substitution Evidence from Singapore. <span class="venue">SSRN, 2026 · <a href="https://doi.org/10.2139/ssrn.6620124" target="_blank" rel="noopener">DOI: 10.2139/ssrn.6620124</a></span></li>
    <li>Nurturing the soul at work: spiritual values and psychological well-being in Vietnamese companies. <span class="venue">Human Resource Development International, 2025 · <a href="https://doi.org/10.1080/13678868.2025.2549549" target="_blank" rel="noopener">DOI: 10.1080/13678868.2025.2549549</a></span></li>
    <li>Internationalization and Firm Performance of Firms in India: The Role of Top Management. <span class="venue">IntechOpen, 2025.</span></li>
    <li>AI in Higher Education: Does AI Fear Hinder Learning Outcomes? <span class="venue">IEEE AIR, 2024 · <a href="https://doi.org/10.1109/air63653.2024.00013" target="_blank" rel="noopener">DOI: 10.1109/air63653.2024.00013</a></span></li>
    <li>The Impact of the Covid-19 Pandemic on the Business Performance of Construction Industry Enterprises in Can Tho City. <span class="venue">Sustainable Development Goals Series, 2023 · <a href="https://doi.org/10.55908/sdgs.v11i12.1751" target="_blank" rel="noopener">DOI: 10.55908/sdgs.v11i12.1751</a></span></li>
    <li>Internationalization and Turkish Manufacturing Firm Performance – Does Managerial Personality Matter? <span class="venue">IntechOpen, 2021 · <a href="https://doi.org/10.5772/intechopen.97432" target="_blank" rel="noopener">DOI: 10.5772/intechopen.97432</a></span></li>
    <li>The moderating effects of managers' experience and gender on internationalization and firm performance of manufacturing enterprises in Turkey. <span class="venue">Academy of Accounting and Financial Studies Journal, 2020 · <a href="https://doi.org/10.5267/j.ac.2020.9.006" target="_blank" rel="noopener">DOI: 10.5267/j.ac.2020.9.006</a></span></li>
    <li class="venue" lang="vi">… cùng 10 công trình khác (meta-analysis review, nghiên cứu FDI Việt Nam, du lịch sinh thái sông Mekong, giá trị tinh thần nơi công sở, AI trong giáo dục bản tiếng Việt) — xem danh mục đầy đủ tại publications.html.</li>
  </ul>

  <h2><span class="lang-vi">Phần mềm &amp; hệ sinh thái số</span><span class="lang-en">Software &amp; digital works</span></h2>
  <ul>
    <li><b>EnQuiz</b> — bilingual offline-first quiz app for Entrepreneurship courses. Zenodo <a href="https://doi.org/10.5281/zenodo.21850735" target="_blank" rel="noopener">DOI: 10.5281/zenodo.21850735</a>; archived at Software Heritage; indexed on OpenAIRE.</li>
    <li><b>M-AIDA</b> and <b>BizOn</b> — open-source teaching tools, published on Zenodo with DOIs.</li>
    <li><b>«Je m'appelle Hương»</b> — personal academic website with 3D garden, multilingual AI tour guide (VI/EN/FR), open-source music catalogue and PWA offline support.</li>
  </ul>

  <h2><span class="lang-vi">Ngôn ngữ</span><span class="lang-en">Languages</span></h2>
  <p><span class="lang-vi">Tiếng Việt (bản ngữ) · Tiếng Anh (thành thạo) · Tiếng Pháp (cơ bản)</span><span class="lang-en">Vietnamese (native) · English (working) · French (basic)</span></p>

